msgctxt "132"
msgid "*sob* Akimoto-kun... Are you really... dead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Mizuki-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"I thought we'd be together forever, just as we always\r\n"
"were..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "I'm sorry I caused you so much pain, Akimoto-kun...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, I'm coming to be with you... Then we can be\r\n"
"together again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Hey, what are you doing!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Don't stop me! I did such horrible things to Akimoto-kun...\r\n"
"The only way I can make up for that is by paying him back\r\n"
"with my life!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Don't be stupid! You really think that'll make Akimoto\r\n"
"happy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "But it's all my fault...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"Mizuki-san, even though you did those terrible things to\r\n"
"Akimoto-san, he still loved you, all that time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "It won't be easy, but you have to live on, Mizuki-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "*sob* Akimoto-kun...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"I can't leave these shoes behind after I jump. They're so\r\n"
"worn out, and they stink, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't want to embarrass Mizuki-chan. Good thing I\r\n"
"realized it before going through with it. It's all thanks\r\n"
"to her..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Is that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Mizuki-chan...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "What's wrong, Mizuki-chan? Why are you crying!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Wait, did this thug do something terrible to you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Dammit! How dare you make Mizuki-chan cry!? I'm gonna make\r\n"
"you regret that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Akimoto-kun... You're alive?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"For now. I was just about to jump. I wanted to swap out the\r\n"
"shoes I was leaving up here, so I went back to my place to\r\n"
"get the right ones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"I thought of the shoes you told me to buy when we went to\r\n"
"Okinawa. Since I'm ending it all, I figured leaving behind a\r\n"
"newer pair would look better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "You idiot..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "To my beloved Mizuki-chan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "I'm sorry things had to end like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "I'm an idiot. I always caused so much trouble for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Despite that, you were always kind to me. Even when I was\r\n"
"annoyed or frustrated, you took the time to cheer me up.\r\n"
"Thank you for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"Even though, in the end, you never loved me... I had a lot\r\n"
"of fun with you, Mizuki-chan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "I was happy just to be by your side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "I'm sorry for everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"Thank you, Mizuki-chan. And goodbye.\r\n"
"                                            Akimoto"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"Wait, are these... Akimoto-san's shoes!? And that letter\r\n"
"must be a suicide note..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "We were too late..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr ""

